*Context: *The readers have spoken. The pick from last week=E2=80=99s Aroun=
d the
Horn issue is: *CAICT launches its first batch of AI Safety/Security
Assessments of 2026
<https://substack.com/redirect/46230543-1376-41b6-a916-99d94e90bf81?j=3DeyJ=
